      "mentions": 42,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring veterinary team and nurses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of clients praise Dr Imre, Kinga, and veterinary nurse Blaise for their attentive consultations and welcoming attitude. While most pet parents express deep gratitude for consistent veterinary care, a few negative reviews cite dismissive interactions or billing disputes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 33,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thoughtful attention for pet comfort"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently observe that pets receive tasty treats, gentle examinations, and kind words throughout their appointments. Clients appreciate that anxious dogs settle down quickly, though two owners felt clinical staff appeared hesitant when dealing with sensitive pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fresh and welcoming clinical facilities"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often compliment the clean, calm, and modern atmosphere of the Chelsea clinic. Visitors appreciate the bright reception space, spotless treatment suites, and relaxed setting, which helps reduce typical clinic stress for both animals and their accompanying owners."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do they accommodate urgent or walk-in appointments?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that the team accommodated emergency visits and fitted in sick pets within 30 minutes when needed."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can clients see the same veterinarian consistently?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate that permanent veterinary staff like Dr Imre allow pet parents to build a consistent relationship over visits."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do they provide photo updates during procedures?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, several reviews highlight that the clinic sends photo updates to give owners peace of mind during day stays."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where is the Chelsea clinic located?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The practice is located on Fulham Road in Chelsea, near local bus connections and South Kensington."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
